   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Never write the FULL 32 KB backup over the cable. It overwrites the\nbootloader while it is running, and the cable stops working.\nFixing that needs an ISP programmer.",
   "originalText": "Never write the FULL 32 KB backup over the cable. It overwrites the\nbootloader while it is running, and the cable stops working.\nFixing that needs an ISP programmer.",
